\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Criticality and the Phase Boundary in Social Contagion. Left to right: Average Total Adoption, Rational Choice Adoption, Social Influence Adoption, and Susceptibility. The empirical social topology exhibits a sharp second-order phase transition marked by a peak in susceptibility. Contagion avalanches (social influence) emerge within a narrow, highly sensitive critical space dictated by combinations of inherent utility (driving field) and social flexibility (temperature).}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
